{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/fbcdba22ab68d2cd26df58d135892fc2.avif?t=1772064998\" width=460 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honest Helper</strong>\u00a0is a top-down, grid-based strategy game where you use time manipulation to defeat all enemies without any casualties. This cute and charming game will challenge your tactical and decision making skills across 30+ levels for hours on end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/72e7caa2a1f50c8dc44fb3f15f839f48.poster.avif?t=1772064998\" width=290 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/72e7caa2a1f50c8dc44fb3f15f839f48.webm?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/72e7caa2a1f50c8dc44fb3f15f839f48.mp4?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graveyards and Gravesouls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> embody a powerful being who can control <i>time</i>. They use this power to go back through history and visit graveyards, conjuring the &quot;soul&quot; of those long deceased in hopes of giving them a longer lease at life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/70b1c6c53bf27fcd68fb4654e9a0eb88.poster.avif?t=1772064998\" width=566 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/70b1c6c53bf27fcd68fb4654e9a0eb88.webm?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/70b1c6c53bf27fcd68fb4654e9a0eb88.mp4?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command to Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save these &quot;souls,&quot; you will need to command their movement and choice of attacks. This also includes any coordinated team strategies that might be required in order to &quot;save&quot; the souls of all those in the graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/725ee69152d7660a33e95ff1eacd578b.poster.avif?t=1772064998\" width=558 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/725ee69152d7660a33e95ff1eacd578b.webm?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/725ee69152d7660a33e95ff1eacd578b.mp4?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bubbles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles</strong>\u00a0are the main way you will be able to save these unfortunate &quot;souls.&quot; Bubbles are pockets in <i>time</i> that act as a separate part of the same environment. This is the <strong>only</strong> way you will be able to turn the tides of the battlefield when the &quot;souls&quot; are heavily outnumbered and outgunned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/1d70bb75f1645688a703c39191074dc8.poster.avif?t=1772064998\" width=346 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/1d70bb75f1645688a703c39191074dc8.webm?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/1d70bb75f1645688a703c39191074dc8.mp4?t=1772064998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good Luck!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"POP!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720430/05d6b18e42347068c257954e6eeb1cead484d2dc.jpg"},{"name":"POP! POP! POP!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720430/ba2e0e0ff8722341cdb9495f5d4c92de88ab9d04.jpg"},{"name":"First Soul Saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720430/1cf029ba80558632d0e40656b4d5717b7a5748c9.jpg"},{"name":"Double Kill!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3720430/6085a9b86de911342b87b7b671c2de7701bd1952.jpg"},{"name":"Cinema","pa